<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.2 Reasoning Classification Accuracy ‣ 4 Results ‣ Compartmentalised Agentic Reasoning for Clinical NLI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Models systematically misroute risk and epistemic tasks as causal</span></a></li>
